  - id: ghost-meter/0
    title: Ghost Meter / Unsent message
    company:
    contract: Ghost Meter
    text: 'MOTH / unverified relay: An occupied apartment is billed for power it never received. MOTH offers payment for the original meter certificate. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before.'
  - id: ghost-meter/1
    title: Ghost Meter / Custody note
    company:
    contract: Ghost Meter
    text: 'Archive custody, Ghost Meter: The meter reports a deliberate disconnection, signed hours before the outage. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
  - id: ghost-meter/2
    title: Ghost Meter / Private annotation
    company:
    contract: Ghost Meter
    text: 'Personal note filed under ghost-meter: The meter reports a deliberate disconnection, signed hours before the outage. Someone has crossed out the word inevitable. No replacement was supplied.'
